# Eval-only judge venv (#463) — ragas's dependency chain (instructor -> openai<3.0.0)
# conflicts with backend/venv's openai==3.3.0 pin, so it lives in its own interpreter,
# talked to over a subprocess boundary. See backend/tests/eval/harness/answer_judge.py
# and rag-evaluation.md's "answer-quality harness" section for why the split exists.
backend/venv-eval/

